'''Mantyke''' (Japanese: '''タマンタ''' ''Tamanta'') is a {{ct|Water}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Secluded Springs}} expansion.

